// Recursive-descent parser with a Pratt expression parser: turns the lexer's token stream into the AST of
// compiler.syntax.ast.  Port of bootstrap/axiom0/src/syntax/parse.c; it produces the same trees and the same
// diagnostics, including error recovery.  Newlines are significant while `Parser.mode_on` is set.
